{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Operator clarification recorded after the foundation changes landed. The writing rules remain in `docs/documentation-policy.md` as authoring guidance. The prohibition applies to mechanical prose or character enforcement that can create false positives. It does not remove the writing rules. Current `origin/main` commit `e22e714c127e02826974cf17ded1fe2c9e2a8ae8` preserves this boundary and limits automated documentation checks to structural contracts."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787403429770039001,"uuid":"7044e94f-0390-46c5-9d02-592d2d8f8557"}